    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***READY TO GO WITH FULL PLANNING PERMISSION***\r\nDNG GLEN CORCORAN are delighted to present to the market this ready to go project with the benefit of Full Planning Permission for the following development: The Demolition Of An Existing Single Storey Extension To The South And The Proposed Construction Of A Single Storey Extension To The South, All Internal Modifications, Domestic Outbuilding, Boundary Treatments, All Associated Siteworks.\r\n\r\nThe proposed development will consist of a spacious 3 Bedroom bungalow of c. 100 sqm. Accommodation to include 3 Bedrooms (1 E-suite), Open Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining Room & Shower Room. Located in a quite cul de sac just a short stroll to the Shannonside Town of Banagher, this property represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking an opportunity to modernise and extend. \r\n\r\n**We have been informed that the current owners have received Grant Approval for €70,000 towards the proposed cost of works. For a new owner to qualify, a new application will have to be submitted to Offaly County Council. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the potential of this delightful home. For further details or to arrange a viewing, please contact DNG GLEN CORCORAN."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "PROPOSED ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\nOPEN PLAN KITCHEN/LIVING/DINING: (8.40m x 3.80m)\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: (4.42m x 2.87m)\r\n\r\nEN-SUITE: (1.95m x 2.75m)\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: (4.42m x 2.96m) \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: (4.42m x 2.87m)\r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM: (2.20m x 1.90m)"
      },
